microVM compute environment. With Vercel Sandbox,&nbsp;
that same isolated compute environment is now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:38.720 --> 00:25:44.960
available to you and your agents. It's the safest&nbsp;
way to write code, run code you didn't write,&nbsp;&nbsp;

